2. Product Vision

Prime UB 2027 is intended to be a modern digital platform for competitions, events, participants, submissions, and merchandise.

The platform should feel like a premium event platform rather than a generic CRUD website.

Core qualities:

modern

energetic

memorable

trustworthy

interactive

responsive

accessible

fast

secure

maintainable

The supplied visual references may inspire the visual direction, but the implementation should evolve into an original and more coherent design system.

3. Core Product Scope

The public website is expected to contain at least:

Home

Competitions

Events

Merchandise

The platform must also provide participant workflows and administrative functionality.

