workflow orchestration

transaction coordination

authorization orchestration

application-level policies

Examples:

RegisterParticipant

RegisterCompetition

CreateSubmission

FinalizeSubmission

CreateOrder

CreatePayment

ProcessPaymentWebhook

Domain

Responsibilities:

business rules

invariants

domain entities

value objects

state transitions

domain policies

